#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:1
msgid "How to Add a New Metric"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:3
msgid ""
"UCM metrics are defined in YAML, registered by `PrometheusStatsLogger`, "
"updated from Python or C++ code, and exported through vLLM's Prometheus "
"`/metrics` endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:7
msgid "Registration Model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:9
msgid "The metrics config drives registration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:11
msgid "`PrometheusStatsLogger` reads the configured YAML file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:12
msgid ""
"It creates `prometheus_client` Counter, Gauge, and Histogram objects with"
" `model_name` and `worker_id` labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:14
msgid ""
"For histograms, it reads the Python Prometheus histogram bucket "
"boundaries and passes those buckets to the C++ metrics library."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:16
msgid ""
"C++ stores counter, gauge, and histogram bucket deltas in per-thread "
"double buffers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:18
msgid ""
"The observability thread periodically calls `get_all_stats_and_clear()` "
"and applies the deltas to `prometheus_client`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:21
msgid ""
"Histograms are aggregated into buckets on the update path. They do not "
"store raw sample vectors, and there is no `histogram_max_length` setting."
" The C++ metrics library appends a `+Inf` bucket during registration when"
" needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:25
msgid "Step 1: Define the Metric in YAML"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:27
msgid ""
"Add the metric to `examples/metrics/metrics_configs.yaml` or to the "
"metrics config used by your deployment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:46
msgid "Use these metric types as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:48
msgid "Counter: pass positive increments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:49
msgid "Gauge: pass the latest value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:50
msgid "Histogram: pass one observation; UCM assigns it to the configured bucket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:52
msgid ""
"Histogram buckets should be sorted in ascending order. You do not need to"
" add `+Inf` in YAML; it is added during registration."
msgstr ""

