#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:85
msgid ""
"Use `NAME_TO_METRIC_ID(\"metric_name\")` on C++ hot paths. It caches "
"metric ID resolution behind a function-local static object and avoids "
"repeated metric name hashing after the first successful resolution. The "
"string overload is still available for non-hot code paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developer-guide/add_metrics.md:90
msgid ""
"Do not add separate `metrics_config` checks around metric updates. If a "
"metric is not registered, the cached ID path records the miss and returns"
" quickly until the registration epoch changes."
msgstr ""

